  "generatedAt": "2026-10-02T17:26:47.875Z",
  "title": "osf review: multi-agent PR review pipeline",
  "summary": "Adds a whole review subsystem to osf: a lens catalogue (20 shipped lenses plus repository overrides), a reviewer roster built from the one agent list in agents.rs, headless reviewer runs in a fresh home with only that reviewer's credential, quote verification of every finding against the checkout, a deterministic reducer that turns answers into a verdict, and a new GitHub Actions workflow that builds osf from the base branch, runs each reviewer in its own job, and posts the decision. It also adds a scan-secret rule, suppression ownership so a marker naming another checker's rule is not reported unused, and a --no-suppress flag for CI.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
